Yes - in fact, even better REXP call(REXP function, REXP .. arguments)  
- that above is just a special case that maps into call(new  
REXPSymbol(function), arguments).
[Actually it's slightly more complicated that than, because you need  
to specify the environment for the call, too]
It's on my ToDo list, but I didn't get around to do it, so  
implementations are highly welcome.

